===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|gladius<2>}}

# [[sword]]
#: {{syn|la|ēnsis|mūcrō|spatha}}
#: {{uxi|la|Mitte '''gladium''' in vaginam.|Put the '''sword''' into its sheath.}}
#: {{uxi|la|in '''gladium''' incumbere|to fall on one's '''sword'''}}
